1
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:30,079
How dare you, you little wretch!

2
00:00:30,519 --> 00:00:32,679
(Cuixi, Xia family maid)
Know your place!

3
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:34,799
You dare defy the madam?

4
00:00:38,171 --> 00:00:39,959
(Wang Qiong, Xia family matriarch)

5
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:40,880
Madam,

6
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,840
I beg you.

7
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,240
Please forgive her.

8
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,640
(Liu Rumei, Xia family concubine)
Punish me as you see fit.

9
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:47,840
Just spare Yunyi.

10
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:48,799
She's still so young.

11
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:49,799
And she's blind.

12
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:52,840
She can't marry a man
who's about to die!

13
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,880
Madam...

14
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:57,560
I beg you, please.

15
00:00:57,679 --> 00:00:59,159
All these years,

16
00:00:59,439 --> 00:01:01,280
I've raised her for this very day:

17
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:03,600
to suffer in Yunshu's stead

18
00:01:03,759 --> 00:01:05,640
(Xia Yunshu, eldest daughter)
and to secure a good life for her.

19
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,760
Otherwise, a blind girl like her

20
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:10,480
would never have survived this long.

21
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:12,239
Madam, please have mercy.

22
00:01:12,239 --> 00:01:13,439
Spare Yunyi.

23
00:01:13,439 --> 00:01:14,840
Spare her!

24
00:01:14,840 --> 00:01:15,400
I'm begging you...

25
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:16,079
Put it on her!

26
00:01:16,959 --> 00:01:18,439
No!

27
00:01:21,799 --> 00:01:22,719
Mother!

28
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:24,599
Mother!

29
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,680
Mother!

30
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:27,879
Let my mother go!

31
00:01:27,959 --> 00:01:29,040
Let my mother go!

32
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:30,040
Let go!

33
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:31,280
Let my mother go!

34
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:33,439
Madam!

35
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:33,920
Please,

36
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:34,799
leave my mother alone!

37
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:35,840
You? Save her?

38
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:36,560
Madam,

39
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,480
(Xia Yunyi, second daughter)
please spare my mother.

40
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:40,159
I'll marry Young General
in my sister's place!

41
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:41,840
Madam...

42
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,359
Mother!

43
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:51,599
You mean it?

44
00:01:51,599 --> 00:01:52,480
I do!

45
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,799
I won't regret it!

46
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:06,000
Such a devoted daughter!

47
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,480
But you're blind.

48
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,800
And only a concubine's daughter.

49
00:02:09,159 --> 00:02:11,400
Why would the Cheng family accept you?

50
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:15,520
Since you've decided
I'll marry for my sister,

51
00:02:15,919 --> 00:02:17,240
I'm sure you have your ways.

52
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,520
Very well.

53
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,680
I'll give you this chance.

54
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,919
Take Lady Liu back to her room.

55
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,479
Without my permission,

56
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,439
she's not to step outside.

57
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:31,199
At dawn tomorrow,

58
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:34,400
send this wretch off
to the Cheng family.

59
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,759
Mother!

60
00:02:52,719 --> 00:02:54,159
(My name is Xia Yunyi.)

61
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:57,560
(My mother
was the Xia family's rightful wife.)

62
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,960
(But Father later made Madam Wang
his principal wife.)

63
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,840
(As far back as I can remember,)

64
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:07,159
(Mother and I have lived
in a neglected courtyard.)

65
00:03:07,599 --> 00:03:08,960
(Father never gave us a second thought.)

66
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:11,680
(Madam Wang and my half-sister
bullied us relentlessly.)

67
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:14,120
(Mother always said
that in this household,)

68
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,960
(those who see too much)

69
00:03:17,800 --> 00:03:19,000
(don't live long.)

70
00:03:21,103 --> 00:03:23,576
♪Amid the sea of faces♪

71
00:03:23,612 --> 00:03:26,560
♪Our eyes meet by chance♪

72
00:03:26,755 --> 00:03:29,933
♪Through the restless years♪

73
00:03:30,028 --> 00:03:33,400
♪Time suddenly slows♪

74
00:03:34,302 --> 00:03:36,473
♪No vows need be made♪

75
00:03:36,511 --> 00:03:39,200
♪Though seas and mountains lie ahead♪

76
00:03:40,016 --> 00:03:42,063
♪One glance says it all♪

77
00:03:42,083 --> 00:03:45,720
♪Beyond a thousand words♪

78
00:03:46,632 --> 00:03:49,905
♪With you by my side♪

79
00:03:49,938 --> 00:03:53,191
♪I dare brave a thousand trials♪

80
00:03:53,217 --> 00:03:56,308
♪Though mist may veil the road ahead♪

81
00:03:56,356 --> 00:03:59,858
♪Hand in hand, no counting years♪

82
00:03:59,875 --> 00:04:03,045
♪With you by my side♪

83
00:04:03,072 --> 00:04:06,720
♪No need to speak my heart at length♪

84
00:04:06,763 --> 00:04:09,723
♪As rivers and mountains change♪

85
00:04:09,780 --> 00:04:11,864
♪May we remain together♪

86
00:04:11,885 --> 00:04:15,440
♪From dawn to dusk♪

87
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:19,440
=Daughter of a Concubine=

88
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:22,360
=Episode 1=

89
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,560
(Wanqing Courtyard)

90
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:38,720
(Nanny Zhao, Xia family servant)
Miss Yunyi, it's me!

91
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,560
Nanny Zhao!

92
00:04:42,639 --> 00:04:43,639
Nanny Zhao,

93
00:04:43,639 --> 00:04:44,759
what are you doing here?

94
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,680
Miss Yunyi,

95
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:49,279
I know you can see.

96
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,720
But even around me,

97
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,879
you must keep up the act

98
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:58,439
and make it convincing.

99
00:04:59,199 --> 00:05:00,680
Tomorrow,

100
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,319
you'll be married.

101
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:06,680
Take this bundle.

102
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:11,759
Some herbs for your eyes, just in case.

103
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,360
And some spending money.

104
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:20,680
What a bunch of jerks!

105
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,600
If the madam hadn't ordered me
to watch you,

106
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,040
who'd care about you at all?

107
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,839
Trash comes from trash.

108
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,639
A whole family of trash!

109
00:05:29,319 --> 00:05:31,279
I can't even catch a quick nap!

110
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,399
Nannie,

111
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:35,800
once I'm settled in
at the Cheng residence,

112
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:38,480
I'll come back for you and Mother.

113
00:05:39,279 --> 00:05:40,879
No one will ever mistreat you again.

114
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,839
That's my girl.

115
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,902
(Xia Residence)

116
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,720
Yunyi,

117
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:54,040
there's something important
I need to tell you.

118
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:55,839
Remember this:

119
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,720
Keep playing

120
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,759
a blind girl.

121
00:06:01,519 --> 00:06:05,000
Whether in the Xia or Cheng family,

122
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:07,439
only by remaining blind,

123
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:09,439
weak,

124
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,720
and obedient

125
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:15,160
will this world spare you.

126
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,279
Only then...

127
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:18,600
will you stay alive.

128
00:06:19,079 --> 00:06:20,120
Mother.

129
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,839
But...

130
00:06:20,839 --> 00:06:21,839
Promise me.

131
00:06:22,959 --> 00:06:23,519
All right.

132
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:24,199
All right.

133
00:06:24,199 --> 00:06:24,720
Mother.

134
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:25,839
I promise.

135
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,680
I'll keep pretending.

136
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,720
I promise.

137
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:34,199
I had this hairpin made for you.

138
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:36,480
It's sharp as a knife.

139
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:38,639
Use it to protect yourself.

140
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:39,680
Mother.

141
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,439
Why are you telling me all this now?

142
00:06:41,439 --> 00:06:42,519
Be a good girl!

143
00:06:43,079 --> 00:06:43,879
Come on.

144
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:45,560
Let me put it on.

145
00:06:48,639 --> 00:06:49,439
Mother!

146
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,560
Mother!

147
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:58,319
Mother...

148
00:06:58,319 --> 00:06:59,120
Something's wrong.

149
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,720
Something's very wrong.

150
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,839
The medicine's been laced!

151
00:07:04,079 --> 00:07:04,920
Help! Someone!

152
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,800
Yunyi, no!

153
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,000
Don't call anyone.

154
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,519
Mother!

155
00:07:09,439 --> 00:07:10,720
They...

156
00:07:11,079 --> 00:07:11,959
Mother!

157
00:07:11,959 --> 00:07:14,040
They just want...

158
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:18,240
to kill me.

159
00:07:18,839 --> 00:07:19,639
Yunyi,

160
00:07:19,879 --> 00:07:21,480
promise me.

161
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,399
At the Cheng residence,

162
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:27,120
don't...

163
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,199
trust...

164
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,319
any...

165
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,759
single one.

166
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,600
Mother!

167
00:07:50,759 --> 00:07:51,879
Mother!

168
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,199
Mother!

169
00:08:05,839 --> 00:08:06,680
Mother!

170
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:14,199
The bride is leaving!

171
00:08:18,279 --> 00:08:19,279
Mother!

172
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,240
Xia Yunyi.

173
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:32,279
Your sister and I came to see you off.

174
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,799
It's a marriage to ward off bad luck,

175
00:08:33,799 --> 00:08:36,080
but at least you're marrying
into a general's family.

176
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:39,240
Lucky you.

177
00:08:50,159 --> 00:08:51,000
Yunyi,

178
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,759
you don't need your eyes,

179
00:08:53,759 --> 00:08:55,000
so keep them covered.

180
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,360
No one needs to see them.

181
00:08:57,279 --> 00:08:58,080
Oh, right.

182
00:08:58,399 --> 00:08:59,559
I forgot to mention.

183
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:03,480
I taught my mother
how to do that paper trick.

184
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:06,840
Your mother was so "pretty" back then.

185
00:09:07,519 --> 00:09:10,000
Her eyes were wide open!

186
00:09:17,039 --> 00:09:19,679
Too bad you can't see that again.

187
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:22,960
(Mother,)

188
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:24,120
(I've failed you.)

189
00:09:24,799 --> 00:09:26,480
(But I'm about to disobey you.)

190
00:09:27,399 --> 00:09:29,000
(Today,)

191
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:31,320
(I will avenge you.)

192
00:09:33,919 --> 00:09:35,000
Yunshu, look out!

193
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:37,759
Yunshu,

194
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:41,120
you said you taught that paper trick?

195
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,519
What are you doing?

196
00:09:42,519 --> 00:09:43,120
Stay still!

197
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,919
Or I'll stab you!

198
00:09:44,919 --> 00:09:47,159
Xia Yunyi, have you lost your mind?

199
00:09:47,159 --> 00:09:47,960
Kneel!

200
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,200
You wouldn't dare!

201
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,279
Fine. I'll kneel...

202
00:10:02,679 --> 00:10:04,440
You taught your mother to use paper.

203
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:06,919
Then today,

204
00:10:06,919 --> 00:10:08,279
I'll use silk.

205
00:10:08,799 --> 00:10:11,000
Paper is cheap. Silk is precious.

206
00:10:11,159 --> 00:10:12,840
Consider it my gift to you!

207
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,480
The first layer

208
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:17,159
is for my mother.

209
00:10:17,919 --> 00:10:18,919
The second layer

210
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:21,919
is for myself.

211
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:23,000
Xia Yunyi!

212
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,360
You monster!

213
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:25,919
Calm down, Madam Wang.

214
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:28,600
Yesterday,

215
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,559
my mother got four layers.

216
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:38,840
Yunshu, keep count.

217
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:40,559
That's only three.

218
00:10:41,519 --> 00:10:42,799
I'm not finished yet.

219
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:46,159
The wedding procession is here!

220
00:10:46,159 --> 00:10:47,879
Madam, the wedding procession
has arrived!

221
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:48,879
The wedding procession is here.

222
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,440
You still dare to kill her?

223
00:10:51,639 --> 00:10:54,200
By Heaven's grace
and our ancestors' blessing,

224
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:56,879
Cheng Mingzhi, son of General Huaiyuan,

225
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:59,639
weds Miss Xia, daughter
of the Director of the Ministry of War,

226
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,320
in hopes that this joyous union

227
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:03,000
will drive away illness

228
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,080
and bring fortune!

229
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:06,159
Let her go!

230
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:07,879
Don't forget,

231
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,159
I still have Nanny Zhao.

232
00:11:10,919 --> 00:11:11,720
(Mother.)

233
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,840
(Is this what you had in mind?)

234
00:11:14,639 --> 00:11:17,279
(You wouldn't want me
to fight them to the death?)

235
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,759
Yunshu,

236
00:11:23,759 --> 00:11:26,360
I'm sparing you this time,
not because I've gone soft,

237
00:11:26,919 --> 00:11:30,039
but so you'll remember every day

238
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:32,399
how this felt.

239
00:11:48,159 --> 00:11:49,000
Guards!

240
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:50,519
Seize that wretch!

241
00:11:50,519 --> 00:11:51,399
Madam Wang!

242
00:11:51,639 --> 00:11:54,080
The wedding procession
is waiting outside.

243
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:56,360
If you won't let me leave,

244
00:11:56,759 --> 00:11:58,360
what will you tell the Cheng family

245
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,480
when they come asking?

246
00:12:25,559 --> 00:12:28,360
I'm Xia Yunyi,
born to a concubine of the Xia family.

247
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:30,200
Madam Wang has rigged this marriage,

248
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:31,879
swapping me for the legitimate one,

249
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,480
to fool the Huaiyuan General's house.

250
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,000
Please look into this!

251
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,720
(Cheng Xiao, Cheng family's second son)

252
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,679
You little wretch!

253
00:12:40,130 --> 00:12:41,840
(Xia Residence)

254
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:46,399
You think the Cheng family cares
who they marry?

255
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,559
All they want

256
00:12:48,559 --> 00:12:51,440
is a daughter of the Xia family
to seal the alliance.

257
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:53,519
Whether she's a legitimate daughter

258
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:55,360
or a concubine's daughter

259
00:12:56,759 --> 00:12:58,200
doesn't matter at all!

260
00:12:59,679 --> 00:13:01,320
Bring in the bride.

261
00:13:12,759 --> 00:13:14,639
Lift the sedan!

262
00:13:14,639 --> 00:13:17,080
Lift the coffin!

263
00:13:29,526 --> 00:13:32,920
(Xia Residence)

264
00:13:35,879 --> 00:13:36,679
(Mother,)

265
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:39,080
(I promise you.)

266
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:43,919
(I may keep playing blind,)

267
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:46,799
(but from now on,)

268
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:49,000
(I will never live on my knees again.)

269
00:13:50,446 --> 00:13:55,560
(Xia Residence)

270
00:13:55,560 --> 00:14:00,993
(Cheng Residence)

271
00:14:14,300 --> 00:14:16,300
(A Legacy of Loyalty and Courage)

272
00:14:53,279 --> 00:14:54,679
Oh, the bride has arrived.

273
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:07,440
(Zhou Lanxin,
Cheng family's second madam)

274
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:09,799
So you really are blind.

275
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:13,600
I'm Xia Yunyi, principal wife
of Young General Huaiyuan.

276
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,679
And you are?

277
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:17,039
I'm the Cheng family's Second Madam.

278
00:15:17,759 --> 00:15:19,320
When you address your aunt,

279
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,879
you'd better kneel.

280
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,559
You're the Cheng family's Second Madam?

281
00:15:28,159 --> 00:15:30,159
Greetings, Second Aunt.

282
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:31,519
By tradition,

283
00:15:32,120 --> 00:15:34,399
a new bride must first kneel
to her elders.

284
00:15:34,519 --> 00:15:35,320
Kneel now.

285
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,480
Forgive me, Second Aunt.

286
00:15:39,879 --> 00:15:43,399
My mother was once
the Xia family's principal wife, too.

287
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,080
She taught me

288
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:47,960
that a wife first kneels
to her parents-in-law.

289
00:15:48,679 --> 00:15:50,360
This house is all about rules.

290
00:15:50,759 --> 00:15:52,960
Surely you understand that, Second Aunt?

291
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,000
(Qiuyue, Cheng family maid)

292
00:15:55,799 --> 00:15:58,080
Quite the sharp tongue for a blind girl!

293
00:15:59,759 --> 00:16:01,240
You haven't heard, have you?

294
00:16:02,279 --> 00:16:03,720
Your groom

295
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:07,320
will soon be carried back in a coffin.

296
00:16:07,759 --> 00:16:09,559
You're only marrying here

297
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:11,480
for appearances.

298
00:16:12,399 --> 00:16:13,320
Someone!

299
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,360
Since the groom isn't here,

300
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,840
you'll have to bow to a rooster instead.

301
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:17,600
Hold her down!

302
00:16:19,399 --> 00:16:19,919
Bow!

303
00:16:29,159 --> 00:16:29,720
Hey!

304
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:30,679
Aunt,

305
00:16:30,679 --> 00:16:32,240
a rooster is the perfect match for you!

306
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,440
Take her back!

307
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,120
How dare you?

308
00:16:37,679 --> 00:16:38,519
Beat her!

309
00:16:45,171 --> 00:16:47,071
(A Legacy of Loyalty and Courage)

310
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,960
Look at you!

311
00:16:57,200 --> 00:16:59,679
You think you're fit
to be a Cheng bride?

312
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:03,480
Whether I'm fit or not

313
00:17:03,799 --> 00:17:06,000
isn't for a Second Madam to decide!

314
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:08,799
You've got quite a mouth on you!

315
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:10,319
I'll say it one last time.

316
00:17:10,599 --> 00:17:12,000
Kneel and bow,

317
00:17:12,400 --> 00:17:13,799
or I'll make you regret it!

318
00:17:13,799 --> 00:17:16,680
If you want me to kneel,
why don't you do it yourself?

319
00:17:17,039 --> 00:17:18,519
Getting servants
to do your dirty work...

320
00:17:18,559 --> 00:17:19,759
Is that all you're capable of?

321
00:17:20,440 --> 00:17:21,599
Bring the brazier!

322
00:17:24,799 --> 00:17:25,640
Light it!

323
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:28,759
Burn the evil out
of this wretched woman!

324
00:18:05,360 --> 00:18:10,680
♪Let the past be buried in the wind♪

325
00:18:12,406 --> 00:18:16,760
♪Perhaps the waning moon knows my pain♪

326
00:18:17,517 --> 00:18:19,797
♪It sees the old tenderness♪
(Cheng Mingzhi, Cheng family eldest son)

327
00:18:19,797 --> 00:18:21,110
♪all come to nothing♪
(Young General Huaiyuan)

328
00:18:21,431 --> 00:18:24,440
♪How many regrets haunt this world♪

329
00:18:24,702 --> 00:18:30,560
♪By the window, whose dreams flicker
by the dying candle♪

330
00:18:33,033 --> 00:18:37,160
♪Things remain, you're gone,
and I'm still dazed♪

331
00:18:38,592 --> 00:18:40,520
♪The sandstorm in my eyes♪

332
00:18:40,673 --> 00:18:43,880
♪Turns to a blade's edge♪

333
00:18:45,457 --> 00:18:46,880
♪Cutting through old years♪

334
00:18:47,108 --> 00:18:48,600
♪We can never embrace again♪

335
00:18:48,723 --> 00:18:53,680
♪If rain has tears,
wash away the dust of fate♪

336
00:18:54,082 --> 00:18:55,680
♪By lamplight, I turn the page♪

337
00:18:55,723 --> 00:18:58,600
♪The ink dries, and there you are♪

338
00:18:58,849 --> 00:19:00,440
♪Gone to ash in a flash♪

339
00:19:00,573 --> 00:19:02,160
♪Like a blade through my heart♪

340
00:19:02,222 --> 00:19:05,673
♪Too late to pull away♪

341
00:19:05,722 --> 00:19:08,080
♪The song ends, and all have gone♪

342
00:19:08,284 --> 00:19:12,240
♪Now we must part♪

343
00:19:12,545 --> 00:19:15,840
♪Flowers burn the ground,
yet vows are held so lightly♪

344
00:19:15,998 --> 00:19:19,240
♪The song ends.
Where shall I seek you in dreams♪

345
00:19:19,776 --> 00:19:21,560
♪By the window, a dying candle♪

346
00:19:21,622 --> 00:19:26,480
♪Whose shadow do I yearn for♪
